flowchart TB
  subgraph roles[Six Python child processes]
    direction LR
    P[Payer] --> M[Merchant / POS]
    M --> G[Gateway / Processor]
    G --> A[Acquirer]
    A --> N[Simulated Visa / Mastercard]
    N --> I[Issuer]
    I -. decision .-> N
    N -. decision .-> A
    A -. decision .-> G
    G -. decision .-> M
    M -. receipt .-> P
  end
  S[Supervisor: inbox queues, stepping, health, observed events]
  B[Browser dashboard: live diagram, balances, trace]
  S <--> roles
  B <-->|local JSON API| S
  M --- C[Merchant owns full capture and batches]
  I --- F[Issuer owns account balance, holds, obligations]
  A --- L[Acquirer records merchant proceeds and illustrative fee buckets]
  classDef actor fill:#EDF5F5,stroke:#007D82,color:#15384A
  class P,M,G,A,N,I actor
